  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 139 + 40 ÷ 5 − 168 × 3 = 283\n\nOption 1) − and +\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 139 - __**40 ÷ 5**__ + 168 × 3 = 283\n\n⇒ 139 - 8 + __**168 × 3**__ = 283\n\n⇒ __**139**__ - 8 __**+ 504**__ = 283\n\n⇒ __**643 - 8**__ = 283\n\n⇒ 635 = 283\n\nOption 2) − and ×\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 139 + __**40 ÷ 5**__ × 168 - 3 = 283\n\n⇒ 139 + __**8 **____**×**____** 168**__ - 3 = 283\n\n⇒ __**139 + 1344**__ - 3 = 283\n\n⇒ - 3 = 283\n\n**Option 3) ÷ and ×**\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 139 + 40 × 5 − __**168 ÷ 3**__ = 283\n\n⇒ 139 + __**40 **____**×**____** 5**__ − 56 = 283\n\n⇒ __**139 + **__**__**2**__00** − 56 = 283\n\n⇒ __**339 − 56**__ = 283\n\n**⇒ 283 = 283**\n\nOption 4) + and ÷\n\nTwo signs need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ __**139 ÷ 40**__ + 5 − 168 × 3 = 283\n\n⇒ 3.475 + 5 − 168 × 3 = 283\n\n⇒ __**3.475 + 5**__ − 504 = 283\n\n⇒ **__8.475 − 504__** = 283\n\n⇒ -495.525 = 283\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**÷ and ×**\".",
